OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with heavy rain clearing
OL,6,Feastwards through the morning. This
OL,7,Fleaves a largely dry afternoon with
OL,8,Fsunny spells developing, but also a
OL,9,Ffew showers. Strong winds easing
OL,10,Fthrough the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers this evening will
OL,13,Flargely clear, with a dry night
OL,14,Ffollowing and long clear periods.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FMostly dry throughout the
OL,17,Fdaytime with some good sunny spells
OL,18,Fbetween patchy amounts of cloud.
OL,19,FModerate winds, but occasionally fresh
OL,20,Faround west coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
